Z||000006||rogergarrison||12-27-2001||06:42 AM||||well Im no cell phone expert.....Qualcom phones are all junk, had 2. Ive had Verizon/cellular one for prob 15 years with no big special problem. Motorola is the best phone manufacturer (in fact communication equip in general) My connections are usually good enough that connecting my laptop to it gets few disconnects. Lisas phone breaks up just as much as anybody elses and shes even got connections   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> no pun intended. Just like everything else, thats why theres variety. BTW, all the different companies all share the same microwave towers, they dont have their 'own'.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||1
