Z||000025||FieroLisa||12-28-2001||01:42 PM||||What I've found is that there are a portion of people with every provider that hate it for some reason, which may be a very good reason, and then there are the portion that love it. Problem is, the people that love it never have a reason to speak up, so you only hear the p!ssed off people, and half the time it wouldn't even be Sprint (or Verizon or AT&T)'s fault.<P>Ah well, that's the reason there are different providers, which are better in different areas. I'm not at work right now, so I don't feel like giving you a sales pitch on why we are better, so I hope whatever new phone service you gets is as perfect as you want it to be, but I gather it won't be, as there are always problems with everyone.<P>||||reg||1
